"""The two engine API contracts of U14-S as data: build_docs.py writes docs/contracts/engine/ml-api.md and fairness-api.md from it,
and the tests read the same data to check the written pages (every function of the sizing's modules with its signature, units,
invariants, light rule and check).

Entry: (name, signature, units, invariants, check). A validation function adds a ``test_id`` and a light rule; a result type is a
frozen dataclass. No golden value is claimed where the dossiers print none (sizing, Modules and functions)."""
from __future__ import annotations

